1
00:00:39,060 --> 00:00:42,060
Let's go to the first email.

2
00:00:42,060 --> 00:00:47,060
It says, Leaving my single parent, mother and elder brother behind.

3
00:00:47,060 --> 00:00:50,060
I hope you're doing well. I watch your Ask Ganji Soek sessions quite regularly.

4
00:00:50,060 --> 00:00:55,060
And after thinking so much, I decided to share my guilt of leaving Pakistan with you.

5
00:00:55,060 --> 00:00:57,060
I believe you'll give me good advice.

6
00:00:57,060 --> 00:01:03,060
I'm 26-year-old woman and I was raised by a single parent, my mother, since I was born.

7
00:01:03,060 --> 00:01:06,060
As my father died when I was six days old.

8
00:01:06,060 --> 00:01:07,060
I'm sorry to hear that.

9
00:01:07,060 --> 00:01:11,320
I have an elder brother. My mother and brother are extremely supportive in every way.

10
00:01:11,800 --> 00:01:15,440
I'm not going to tell all the difficulties and hard times I have experienced in my life.

11
00:01:15,580 --> 00:01:24,060
I know that everyone can imagine how difficult it must be for a widow and her children to live a life on their own without any support, be it financial or financial.

